			"notes": "- **Get Materials pulls only what's still needed:** pressing it again (boxes full, put away, pull again) only pulls what's still missing for that material list.\n- **Works with Carpet's stacked shulker boxes:** when the single boxes are full, one empty box is split off a stack into a free slot and filled.\n- Mod icon (Cytra logo).\n\nClient needs Litematica 0.26.16+ and MaLiLib 0.27.20+. The server part is optional (instant/area fill, linked storage, restock, shared groups, material pull)."
